Story:
A famous staircase in Tokyo has become a global tourist attraction thanks to a certain animated film. Thousands of fans visit it every year to re-create an emotional scene between two characters who “finally meet.”

But we won’t tell you the movie name. Instead, here are your clues:

Hint:

